# Build a Page — Agentic Workflow

Follow in order. Standards: `docs/standards/`. Task AC: `docs/development-plan.md`.

## 1. Discover
- Read task **Done when** in development-plan
- Read API contract in `docs/user-journey-api.md`
- List shadcn + shared components; find similar page

## 2. Scaffold
- `src/features/{FeatureName}/` — pages, hooks, types, query-keys
- Thin route only; types mirror API

## 3. Data Layer
- One hook per query/mutation; colocated `query-keys.ts`
- `apiRequest()` with correct context headers

## 4. Client State
- Zustand for UI-only state — never server cache

## 5. Compose
- shadcn + shared components; four UI states

## 6. Styles
- Tailwind tokens; mobile-first 375px / 1280px

## 7. Test
- Colocated Vitest + RTL + MSW per `docs/standards/testing-strategy.md`
- Skill: `write-feature-tests`

## 8. Verify
- Task **Done when** + universal DoD
- `tsc --noEmit`, `pnpm lint`, `pnpm test -- {feature}`
- Audit skill if UI changed

## 9. Commit (user request only)
- Skill: `write-commit-message`
- Format: `docs/standards/commit-messages.md`
- Footer: `Task: {plan-id}`
